<title>SWEDEN: Swedish airports handle 23 pct more freight in Jan.</title>
<headline>Swedish airports handle 23 pct more freight in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish airports handled 11,821 tonnes of freight in January, a rise of 23 percent over the same</p>
<p>month a year ago, Sweden's civil aviation administration</p>
<p>Luftfartsverket said.</p>
<p> SWEDISH AIRPORT ACTIVITY		     January</p>
<p>						  1997	  1996</p>
<p> Cargo (in tonnes)			 11,821	 9,617</p>
<p> Mail (in tonnes)			   2,712	 2,234</p>
<p> Landings				    25,611	23,363</p>
<p> Passengers (in millions)		  1.32	  1.23</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1003</p>
</text>
